WEBVTT

00:00:00.450 --> 00:00:03.251
Video 21. Payroll.

00:00:03.451 --> 00:00:05.515
Payroll na paanch steps chhe.

00:00:05.445 --> 00:00:09.361
Pehla masters: karmachaario ane pay heads.

00:00:09.291 --> 00:00:14.351
Pachhi dar mahine: haajri, payroll voucher ane
pay slips.

00:00:14.651 --> 00:00:22.544
Alter, Employee, Ramesh Patel. Karmachaari ni
jodaavaani taarikh ane salary details chhe.

00:00:23.245 --> 00:00:30.780
Pay heads etle kamaani ane kapaat: Basic
Salary, House Rent Allowance, EPF ane ESI.

00:00:32.657 --> 00:00:39.781
V, pachhi payroll maate Ctrl+F4, ane haajri
maate Ctrl+F5 dabaavo.

00:00:40.478 --> 00:00:48.305
Ctrl+F thi Attendance Autofill khule chhe.
Present pasand karo, ane 26 divas lakho.

00:00:49.005 --> 00:00:57.504
Ctrl+A thi banne karmachaari bharaay chhe, ane fari
Ctrl+A thi attendance voucher save thaay chhe.

00:00:58.584 --> 00:01:07.136
Ctrl+F4 thi payroll voucher khule chhe. Ctrl+F
thi Payroll Autofill: October no pagaar.

00:01:07.166 --> 00:01:13.644
Ctrl+A thi darek karmachaari no pagaar ganaay
chhe. Darek pay head

00:01:13.294 --> 00:01:19.554
teno niyam bataave chhe: flat rate, athva EPF
maate basic na 12%.

00:01:19.584 --> 00:01:23.763
Ctrl+A thi payroll voucher save thaay chhe.

00:01:24.843 --> 00:01:29.634
Alt+G, pay slip: darek karmachaari no net pay.

00:01:30.912 --> 00:01:42.088
Enter thi Ramesh Patel ni pay slip dekhaay chhe:
kamaani ₹21,000, kapaat ₹1,913, net pay ₹19,087.

00:01:42.568 --> 00:01:47.605
₹21,000 maanthi, Ramesh ne ₹19,087 male chhe.

00:01:47.535 --> 00:01:52.726
EPF ane ESI, PF ane ESI fund ma jaay chhe.

00:01:52.926 --> 00:01:56.497
Aagalno video: Backup ane Restore.

